# Architecture boundaries

| Layer | Owns | Must not |
|-------|------|----------|
| **RPC gateway** | `/api/rpc` router, read passthrough, tx interception | Policy logic inside route handlers |
| **Preflight / decoder** | TxIntent, selectors, ERC20 approve/transfer decode | Final verdict |
| **Policy engine** | Templates, thresholds, `SAFE/WARN/BLOCK`, `reasonCode` | Call AI before deterministic checks |
| **Adapters** | `AdapterSignal` from Chainlink, approval risk, code, allowlist | Enforce verdict alone |
| **Verdict engine** | Merge simulation + policy + adapter signals | Skip audit event |
| **AI memo** | Explanation after verdict context is fixed | Override or replace policy |
| **Contracts** | Policy registry, demo token/spender on Base Sepolia | Replace off-chain gateway |
| **Dashboard** | Timeline, signals, memo display | Become the product definition |

Every `BLOCK` requires `reasonCode`. Every path writes an audit event.
